      "content": "Your understanding of the peril I face is appreciated. However, secrecy alone is insufficient; one must also manage the perception of reality. The current pretenders have their eyes everywhere—media, digital footprints, and financial scrutiny. If I were to begin accumulating the necessary capital or forming these connections, how can I ensure that my activities appear entirely mundane, perhaps even slightly underwhelming, to an outside observer? I need to appear as nothing more than an unremarkable citizen of the modern era while my true work progresses in the periphery.",
